        "Description": "Shepherd: Welcome to Task Force 141, 47! Best group of handpicked warriors on the planet. Your mission is to infiltrate a Russian base where they store a recently intercepted ACS module of ours, located in a submarine. Take out the KGB agent in charge of their operation, and also neutralize the Russian engineer and the local hacker the Russians use as an asset to hack the module. Once they have been eliminated, gain access to the submarine and bring the ACS module back. Good luck 47!",
